WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:05.648
The same ball, saved from the editor three ways. Which file do you need?

2
00:00:07.167 --> 00:00:15.500
SVG plus CSS: the smallest file, and no script at all. It plays on load, or on hover.

3
00:00:29.767 --> 00:00:36.271
With the editor's small trigger script inside, it can also start on click, or when scrolled into view.

4
00:00:51.467 --> 00:00:59.173
SVG plus JS carries the player itself: every kind of animation, and the full playback API.

5
00:01:11.067 --> 00:01:16.448
Pick the smallest file that does what you need. The editor tells you which one can.
